+### Forward supersession: Vendor and Store identity
+
+This document records the accepted `v0.5.1` historical-import architecture, including the Vendor display-name behaviour used by that slice.
+
+For `v0.5.3` and later work, Vendor naming is superseded by the canonical Vendor contract in:
+
+```text
+docs/Design/0.5/Cross-Audit.md
+```
+
+Later work must use the canonical official supplier name as Vendor identity and preserve Store/location separately as metadata. Store/location must not be appended to or encoded into Vendor identity.
+
 ## System of record

